{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkip5jbtU7oHNZzjtf3C","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with Harel's **\"עוקב מדד S&P 500\"** track (קופה 13414). I'm fairly sure, maybe a bit too sure. What decided it was the name: that's literally the \"S&P\" thing my friends at work talk about. It's also one of the few rows with real numbers: \"13.7%\" for 3 years, \"11.92%\" for 5, and \"2.3 מיליארד ₪\" in it, so lots of people trust it. Fees looked the same everywhere, around \"0.56% מהחיסכון\" and \"0% מההפקדה\", so the fee didn't decide anything.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n- **Top.** The big \"הראל\" heading. I know Harel from ads, so I stayed. \"כל המוצרים של הראל\" had the \"קופת גמל להשקעה 16\" button already lit.\n- **Under the buttons.** One line: \"16 מסלולים · דמי ניהול מהחיסכון: מ־0.54% עד 0.61%\". So all the fees are close.\n- **The table.** I went down the names on the right. Most rows say \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" instead of a return, so they're new and there's nothing to compare. \"עוקב מדד S&P 500\" jumped out with the biggest return I saw. The only other big ones were \"8.6%\" on an אג\"ח row and \"4.25%\" on \"כספי (שקלי)\".\n- **The circles.** For S&P they show \"מניות 99%\" and \"מט\"ח 99%\". I guessed מט\"ח means it's in dollars. Fine with me.\n- **Below the table.** A grey line about the \"התקרה בחוק\" (legal fee cap), which I skipped. The heading \"מה כתוב במסמכים של הראל\" had a list of folds under it, which I didn't open. The search box at the bottom I ignored. I'd have closed the page there.\n\n**What I didn't get:**\n- \"מט\"ח\"\n- \"חשיפה\"\n- \"מהחיסכון\" vs \"מההפקדה\": two different fees? Which one do I actually pay?\n- The \"הלכה יהודית\" tag\n- \"PF-10\"\n- \"123 מקור / 123 מחושב\"\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- Most of the 16 tracks show no return at all, so I can't really compare them.\n- The fees as percents all look like nothing. I don't know what that is in shekels on 30,000.\n- I couldn't tell if a few hundred a month is even possible here.\n- The page doesn't say what the first step is or how to open the fund. I'd have to go find that somewhere else."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1879,"cache_read_input_tokens":9893,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1879},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2a5ef32d-4209-43e6-8fe9-370c10b23563","uuid":"a72a512e-9ffe-4678-8364-86ff0944ef48","timestamp":"2026-11-06T00:23:54.561Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkip5Wx5NYajJGqjjcXQ"}
